# V3 Code — Local & Privacy-First Configuration
#
# V3 Code has zero telemetry, zero auto-updates, zero Clerk/Relay cloud dependencies,
# and is isolated from official T3 Code installations (~/.v3, port 3873, v3code://).

# Optional: override the local state/data home directory (defaults to ~/.v3)
# V3CODE_HOME=~/.v3

# Optional: override the HTTP/WS server port (defaults to 3873)
# V3CODE_PORT=3873

# Optional: bind host (defaults to 127.0.0.1; set 0.0.0.0 only for explicit LAN/Tailscale use)
# V3CODE_HOST=127.0.0.1
